          <div class="shot-row"><span class="font-mono text-muted">SKM2QA…</span><span class="flex-1 truncate">Adm 0987 · Transport</span><IconCheckCircle class="w-4 h-4 text-mint" /></div>
          <div class="shot-row"><span class="font-mono text-muted">SKN8PL…</span><span class="flex-1 truncate">“grade 4 fees”</span><span class="tx-badge tone-peach">Review</span></div>
