        <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-soft">Swap the Gmail address on your invoices for <span class="font-mono text-ink text-base">you@yourcompany.co.ke</span>. We set you up on Private Email or Spacemail, move your old mail across and support it from the same portal as everything else.</p>
