          <div class="flex gap-3"><IconInbox class="w-5 h-5 text-brand shrink-0 mt-0.5" /><div><p class="font-semibold text-sm">Old mail moved over</p><p class="text-sm text-muted mt-0.5">From Gmail, Yahoo or your last host, folders and all.</p></div></div>
